      "claim": "The mass killing of the captured persons constitutes a grave breach of the Geneva Conventions and a war crime of wilful killing under the Rome Statute.",
      "reasoning": "Article 8(a)(i) of the Rome Statute enumerates \"Wilful killing\" as a war crime. The facts show that at least 200 persons who were hors de combat as prisoners of war were deliberately shot, satisfying the element of intentional killing of protected persons.",
